  "review": "<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 mb-4\">【2026年最新】銀山温泉おすすめ旅館10選！大正ロマンのガス灯夜景＆予約攻略ガイド</h2>\n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">銀山川の両岸に大正から昭和初期の木造3層・4層建築が立ち並ぶ「銀山温泉」。夕暮れ時に灯るガス灯、石畳に舞い落ちる雪、ノスタルジックな橋の欄干。</p>\n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">この記事では、銀山温泉の宿の特徴を整理し、<strong>「大正ロマン・露天寝湯・木造名建築」で絶対に失敗しない厳選10選</strong>をご紹介します！</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-2 my-6 flex items-center gap-2\">🗺️ 銀山温泉・尾花沢エリアの立地＆アクセス</h2>\n<div class=\"my-4 p-4 bg-stone-900 text-amber-300 font-mono text-xs rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto shadow-inner leading-relaxed\"><pre>【JR大石田駅】（山形新幹線「つばさ」停車駅）\n      │\n      │ 各宿の無料送迎バスで約30分 / 路線バスで約40分\n      ▼\n【銀山温泉 温泉街手前】（仙峡の宿 銀山荘・大型駐車場）\n      │\n      │ 徒歩約5分\n      ▼\n【銀山温泉街中心・銀山川沿い】（能登屋旅館・旅館藤屋・古山閣・古勢起屋）</pre></div>\n<li class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 ml-4 list-disc my-1\"><strong>東京駅 ⇔ 大石田駅</strong>: 山形新幹線「つばさ」で約3時間15分直通</li>\n<li class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 ml-4 list-disc my-1\"><strong>大石田駅 ⇔ 銀山温泉</strong>: 送迎バスで約30分</li>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-2 my-6 flex items-center gap-2\">🏆 銀山温泉：後悔回避の厳選10選</h2>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n\n        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">厳選名宿</span>\n            <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">1. 銀山温泉 仙峡の宿 銀山荘（銀山温泉）</h3>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.43</span>\n        </div>\n      \n\n          <div class=\"mb-4\">\n            <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/111234/111234.jpg\" alt=\"銀山温泉　仙峡の宿　銀山荘 施設外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-52 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n          </div>\n        \n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\"><strong>〜銀山温泉随一の絶景露天寝湯！温泉街徒歩5分の快適温泉旅館〜</strong></p>\n<h4 class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border mt-3.5 mb-1.5 inline-block text-amber-900 bg-amber-50/80 border-amber-200 font-bold\">① どんな旅行に向いている宿か</h4>\n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">カップル、女子旅、雪景色鑑賞、快適性重視。</p>\n<h4 class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border mt-3.5 mb-1.5 inline-block text-emerald-900 bg-emerald-50 border-emerald-300 font-black\">⑦ 「だから、この旅行ならここ」</h4>\n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\"><strong>「銀山温泉の情緒と開放的な絶景温泉露天風呂を満喫するなら迷わずここ！」</strong></p>\n<h4 class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border mt-3.5 mb-1.5 inline-block text-amber-900 bg-amber-50/80 border-amber-200 font-bold\">⑧ 楽天トラベルで空室・料金を確認</h4>\n\n        <div class=\"pt-4 text-center\">\n          <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F111234%2F111234.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n            ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】銀山温泉　仙峡の宿　銀山荘 の最新空室・限定お得プランを見る\n          </a>\n        </div>\n      \n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n\n        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">厳選名宿</span>\n            <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">2. 銀山温泉 能登屋旅館（銀山温泉街中）</h3>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.85</span>\n        </div>\n      \n\n          <div class=\"mb-4\">\n            <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/183204/183204.jpg\" alt=\"銀山温泉　能登屋旅館 施設外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-52 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n          </div>\n        \n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\"><strong>〜国の登録有形文化財！大正10年完成の木造4層楼閣のシンボル〜</strong></p>\n<h4 class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border mt-3.5 mb-1.5 inline-block text-amber-900 bg-amber-50/80 border-amber-200 font-bold\">① どんな旅行に向いている宿か</h4>\n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">歴史建築好き、記念日、憧れの宿泊。</p>\n<h4 class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border mt-3.5 mb-1.5 inline-block text-emerald-900 bg-emerald-50 border-emerald-300 font-black\">⑦ 「だから、この旅行ならここ」</h4>\n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\"><strong>「銀山温泉のシンボルである本物の文化財木造楼閣に泊まるならここ！」</strong></p>\n<h4 class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border mt-3.5 mb-1.5 inline-block text-amber-900 bg-amber-50/80 border-amber-200 font-bold\">⑧ 楽天トラベルで空室・料金を確認</h4>\n\n        <div class=\"pt-4 text-center\">\n          <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F183204%2F183204.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n            ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】銀山温泉　能登屋旅館 の最新空室・限定お得プランを見る\n          </a>\n        </div>\n      \n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n\n        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\